{"title": "Scratch's Ball", "pageid": 20750, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Scratch's_Ball", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ball_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Ball_Faded.png/300px-Ball_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/2/22/Ball_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Scratch's Ball image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Ball_Faded.png/300px-Ball_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Ball_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Scratch's Ball</b> is a common <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous</a> item used to play fetch with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scratch\" title=\"Scratch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Scratch.png/25px-Portrait_Scratch.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Scratch.png/38px-Portrait_Scratch.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Scratch.png/50px-Portrait_Scratch.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scratch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Scratch.png/25px-Portrait_Scratch.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ee/Portrait_Scratch.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scratch\" title=\"Scratch\">Scratch</a>. Having it in the inventory allows to summon Scratch as a familiar outside of camp. It is a specially-named variation of the common <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ball\" title=\"Ball\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Ball_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ball_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Ball_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ball_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Ball_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Ball_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Ball_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ball_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Ball_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ball\" title=\"Ball\">Ball</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>The exterior of this toy ball is rough with tooth marks.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.15 kg (0.3 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.15 kg (0.3 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-8dcd4f980cc8b961END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-7e9eabe161ded398END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOOT_TEST_Toy_Ball_Small_Scratch</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOOT_TEST_Toy_Ball_Small_Scratch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOOT_TEST_Toy_Ball_Small_Scratch\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">10df0443-eef7-4765-be17-ce2dbb8b3eb5</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:10df0443-eef7-4765-be17-ce2dbb8b3eb5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:10df0443-eef7-4765-be17-ce2dbb8b3eb5\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"> <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> </span>\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/38px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/50px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a> the ball.\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</li>\n<li>If throwing the ball while <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scratch\" title=\"Scratch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Scratch.png/25px-Portrait_Scratch.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Scratch.png/38px-Portrait_Scratch.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Scratch.png/50px-Portrait_Scratch.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scratch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Scratch.png/25px-Portrait_Scratch.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ee/Portrait_Scratch.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scratch\" title=\"Scratch\">Scratch</a> is in the vicinity he picks it up and returns it.</li>\n<li>If he is not in the vicinity <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Scratch\" title=\"Find Familiar: Scratch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp/25px-Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp/38px-Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp/50px-Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar: Scratch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp/25px-Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Scratch\" title=\"Find Familiar: Scratch\">Find Familiar: Scratch</a> is automatically used, if available. </li></ul></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Scratch\" title=\"Find Familiar: Scratch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp/60px-Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp/80px-Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar: Scratch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Scratch\" title=\"Find Familiar: Scratch\">Find Familiar: Scratch</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Cast as a level 1 spell (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Obtained from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scratch\" title=\"Scratch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Scratch.png/25px-Portrait_Scratch.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Scratch.png/38px-Portrait_Scratch.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Scratch.png/50px-Portrait_Scratch.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scratch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Scratch.png/25px-Portrait_Scratch.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ee/Portrait_Scratch.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scratch\" title=\"Scratch\">Scratch</a> in camp</li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Scratch must be convinced to give the ball to the player character. There are several options to do this:\n<ul><li>Passing a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/25px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/38px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/50px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Strength\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/25px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png/25px-Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png/38px-Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png/50px-Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sleight of Hand\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png/25px-Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\">Sleight of Hand</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Animal_Handling\" title=\"Animal Handling\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Animal_Handling_Icon.png/25px-Animal_Handling_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Animal_Handling_Icon.png/38px-Animal_Handling_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Animal_Handling_Icon.png/50px-Animal_Handling_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Animal Handling\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Animal_Handling_Icon.png/25px-Animal_Handling_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Animal_Handling_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Animal_Handling\" title=\"Animal Handling\">Animal Handling</a> check to retrieve the ball</li>\n<li>Using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals\" title=\"Speak with Animals\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/25px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/38px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/50px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Speak with Animals\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/25px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals\" title=\"Speak with Animals\">Speak with Animals</a> and simply asking him to hand it over</li></ul></li>\n<li>If losing Scratch's Ball, it is possible to go see him at the camp and he might give it back.</li>\n<li>The ball makes a distinctive 'squeaky toy' sound when picked up or interacted with.</li>\n<li>The ball must be directly in the character's inventory. If it is inside a container in the inventory, the action appears in the hotbar but is unusable.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202010\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.095 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.101 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4171/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 48754/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15205/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.023/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1373987/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   82.519      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%   82.519      1 -total\n 51.68%   42.643     17 Template:Icon_text\n 45.42%   37.479     42 Template:Trim\n 32.04%   26.440      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 31.96%   26.374      1 Template:PageSeo\n 28.75%   23.723     10 Template:Icon_link\n 18.04%   14.884     19 Template:Ifempty\n 17.61%   14.529      3 Template:CharLink\n 12.04%    9.936      2 Template:Uid\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:20750-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202010 and revision id 313772. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}